# AI assistant config and notes. NOT PUBLISHED (owner, 2026-09-15): this is a
# public repository and the tooling used to build the project is not part of
# the deliverable. Untracked with `git rm --cached`, which leaves the files on
# disk and working -- CLAUDE.md is read from the filesystem, not from git.
CLAUDE.md
.claude/
docs/VSCODE_PROMPT_GUIDE.md

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo

# generated native folders
/ios
/android

# Figma design reference exports (temporary build reference; originals live in Figma)
design-refs/

# FCM service-account private keys. Android push is relayed through Firebase
# Cloud Messaging (Google allows no other transport), and Expo needs a service
# account key to talk to it -- but that key is a SECRET and belongs only in
# EAS credentials, never in the repo. Same rule as the Gemini/Resend/Supabase
# service-role keys.
#
# NOTE: google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored. It carries no secret
# (it is embedded in every APK), and EAS builds from a git archive -- ignoring
# it would silently drop it from the build and Android push would fail again.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-service-account*.json

# HeFRA source PDF: the extracted list is committed instead (scripts/extract-hefra.py)
docs/FACILITIES-WITH-VALID-LICENCES*.pdf

# Personal thesis-writing guides: local only, never committed
docs/thesis-evidence*.md
